summary:
  A file whose writer has ended is opened twelve seconds short of its last sound.

history:
  A pause that outlasts the window leaves a finished file, and Play resumes
  at the pause. Kept clear of an unfinished end the file no longer has, the
  listener would be put back twelve seconds for nothing, and the last
  twelve seconds before a window's cap could not be reached by a reopen.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
  windowFull ? 0 : TimeshiftLogic.OPEN_GAP_MS

replace:
  windowFull ? TimeshiftLogic.OPEN_GAP_MS : TimeshiftLogic.OPEN_GAP_MS

expect:
  Killed by tst_timeshiftengine::test_a_file_that_no_longer_grows_is_resumed_at_the_park.
  Line-neutral.
